/**
 * Copy for the swap / bridge / alternative pages in the site's SEO languages (same set and prefixes
 * as the coin pages: en without prefix, /es, /pt-BR, /tr, /ru, /vi, /id).
 *
 * Every function returns plain text; route-pages.js escapes it.
 * Facts only: no invented volumes, users, audits or times — fees and time are «shown before you sign».
 * Brand policy: no Hyperliquid / Polymarket / Kalshi / Backed / xStocks in the copy.
 *
 * p (swap / bridge) = { a, b, aSym, bSym, t, tOut, from, to, fromGas, toGas, same, xvm, fromL1,
 *                       wallet, toAddr, rate, time }
 * p (alt) = { name, type }
 */

